# Game Specification: [Game Title]

Use this document to describe the game the player should experience. State observable behavior,
content, rules, constraints, and desired presentation. Leave libraries, renderer techniques,
shader selection, module layout, and general engineering standards to the generator's renderer
profile and engineering policy.

Remove instructions and sections that do not apply before using the specification.

